; same colour words: every pixel has its Spec256 colour (yellows, white eye, orange beak), and a hole closed on
; all sides is black. It stays yellow whatever colour the cage has. Each frame also has a wing line made of clear
; pixels that chuckie.gfx colours gold, 69=E3A200 and 70=EFCE00; they are painted too, so nothing behind the duck
