;
; THE CAGE. The map at 61A8 draws it from 14 tiles of the tile table, numbers 168-181 (8A30-8A9F): 168-169 are
; the ring on top, 170-173 the dome, 174-177 the bars and 178-181 the base. Spec256 colours it gold:
;   68=D77900 (dark)  69=E3A200 (mid)  70=EFCE00 (light)  255=ring (DFDF7F, white mixed with the yellow ink)
; Mr. Telmo asked for silver, so the same shades are replaced by Spec256's greys (dark to light):
;   68->9E9E9E  69->BABABA  70->DBDBDB  ring->DBDBDB
; To get the gold back, use the four gold colours above in place of the greys.
