; In chuckie.gfx every pixel of the egg has its own shade, from 74=797959 (dark edge) to 7=E7FFFF and
; 15=FFEFEF (highlight), so each pixel gets a colour word (Spec256 index 0 stays 8000). Egg bitmap (set bits):
