; THE GAME WITH FAST2 (tmp/ChuckieEgg, src/fast2.asm), as built for the tape with the tunes.  The commands above are for
; the original routines, which this game still runs in part.  The commands below are for the patch's own drawing code.
; Each stands for what its Z80 instruction does to the data, done to the pixels' colour words (registers: A = 3, C = 4,
; B = 5, E = 6, D = 7, L = 8, H = 9).  The hens' frames above (809010-80910F) have their colour tags written out as
; colour words (lines marked "was FFFC").  Made by scripts/mk_dux2.py from the listing of the build.
